message: "If you use this repository, please cite the associated manuscript and this software archive."
title: "Controlled Attribution and Robustness in IoT Wireless Sensor Networks"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Bhardwaj
    given-names: Shivam
  - family-names: Srivastava
