repository-code: "https://github.com/DrShivamBhardwaj/Relevance_Aware_RE_ETX_"
abstract: "Simulation code and archived validation artifacts for controlled attribution of clustering, relevance-aware reporting, and residual-energy-aware ETX routing in IoT wireless sensor networks. The repository README and reproducibility guide distinguish the earlier public C1--C7 validation archive from the later frozen J0--J7 journal study."
keywords:
  - wireless sensor networks
  - Internet of Things
  - relevance-aware reporting
  - RE-ETX
  - cluster-head selection
  - AD-CWOA
